file tools/fixtures/c/card_pin_claim_scan.sh the loom -- reads the card's blocked-booking claim against the capacity scan's own pin_deadlocked, gates claim_disagreements at zero, reports the converse and the citation reading
file tools/fixtures/c/card_pin_claim_control.sh 28 cases on real files in a throwaway pen, refusals planted then lifted, the citation exemption and the case-folding each mutation-bitten
file tools/ca/card_pin_claim_witness.rish proves the quoting, both refusals and the honest-claim welcome on metal, pins the pen's case count so a deleted leg reds, and reports every binding's capture in its own refusal message
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri card_pin_claim seated at tier lap -- it reads one card and one scan, and that card is the page every lap chooses its work from
file construction/REDS.md census headline carried to 706 and the remainder to 686; the row itself stands on its shelf
file construction/archive/REDS-the-card-said-walled-the-meter-said-door-rows-706.md the row born on its own shelf, the pin holding 15 bytes
file construction/ITINERARY.md clause (2) struck and pointed at the instrument; the Reds first directive widened to say capacity comes from the scan; the INCENSE account rewritten, elder shelved
file construction/archive/20260911-034352_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the elder INCENSE account, moved whole with its links re-anchored by the tool
rota_reading the air row asks where each thing ends, and the answer here is that a boundary a page SPELLS ends wherever the page was last edited, while a boundary an instrument DERIVES ends where the thing itself ends
scope one red booked and closed, one booked row folded, one loom seated, the card's stale capacity claim struck and its directive widened
status GREEN -- card_pin_claim GREEN on metal with 28/28 pen cases, the quoting proven rather than promised, and the refusal proven against the card's own committed bytes; tool_letter_room, equinox_e123_living_pin_guard, reds_pin_capacity, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_fold, reds_status_consistency, unshared_citation, tracked_link, living_card_ascii, ascii_document, exec_bit, prose_register and standing_equipment all GREEN after the repairs; cold 251 green 0 red 2 gated tree_moved=no; closing hot 252 green, 0 red, 2 gated, tree_moved=no, the new guard running as the pass's 252nd in 16s
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the pin holds 16 OPEN rows and 9 name you or a gate, so 7 bytes and one foldable row is the whole margin eight ships book reds into. Raising the bound, or your word on those nine, is the only thing that moves that arithmetic; everything else on my lane's front is agent-doable.
